  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multilateral Aid-for-Trade Technical Assistance and Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports aid-for-trade capacity building and technical assistance, including by supporting developing country participation in aid-for-trade conferences and meetings. It also supports the engagement of expert consultants to provide training for regional developing country officials, research and analysis of aid-for-trade trends in the Indo-Pacific, and trade-related development outcomes in the context of the WTO Global Review of Aid-for-Trade and other relevant regional and international forums.</narrative>
  </description>
